#: ../../source/connectivity/index.md:6
msgid "Connectivity"
msgstr "连接性"

#: ../../source/connectivity/index.md:8
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/connectivity/index.md:10
msgid ""
"UniSDK integrates BLE (Bluetooth Low Energy) Controller (Link Layer), "
"providing fundamental wireless connectivity for BLE application "
"development."
msgstr "UniSDK 集成了 BLE（低功耗蓝牙）控制器（链路层），为 BLE 应用开发提供基础的无线连接能力。"

#: ../../source/connectivity/index.md:12
msgid "Code Location"
msgstr "代码位置"

#: ../../source/connectivity/index.md
msgid "BLE Controller Directory"
msgstr "BLE 控制器目录"

#: ../../source/connectivity/index.md:27
msgid "Coding Standards"
msgstr "编码规范"

#: ../../source/connectivity/index.md:29
msgid ""
"The BLE Controller follows strict coding standards to ensure performance "
"and reliability:"
msgstr "BLE 控制器遵循严格的编码规范，以确保性能和可靠性："

#: ../../source/connectivity/index.md:31
msgid "File Naming"
msgstr "文件命名"

#: ../../source/connectivity/index.md:33
msgid ""
"Source files use lowercase letters and underscores, e.g., "
"`tlk_ble_ll_acl.c`"
msgstr "源文件使用小写字母和下划线，例如 `tlk_ble_ll_acl.c`"

#: ../../source/connectivity/index.md:35
msgid "Function Naming"
msgstr "函数命名"

#: ../../source/connectivity/index.md:37
msgid "Public functions use the `tlk_ble_` prefix"
msgstr "公共函数使用 `tlk_ble_` 前缀"

#: ../../source/connectivity/index.md:38
msgid "Internal functions use the `_` prefix"
msgstr "内部函数使用 `_` 前缀"

#: ../../source/connectivity/index.md:40
msgid "Interrupt Functions"
msgstr "中断函数"

#: ../../source/connectivity/index.md:42
msgid "Interrupt handler functions have specific naming and modifier requirements"
msgstr "中断处理函数有特定的命名和修饰符要求"

#: ../../source/connectivity/index.md:43
msgid ""
"Interrupt functions should be as short as possible, avoiding complex "
"operations"
msgstr "中断函数应尽可能简短，避免复杂操作"

